    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Idle RPG with Fully Automated Battles.</strong><br>Lead your heroes and armies to conquer challenging stages and powerful bosses. Through equipment, skills, and hero class changes, you can forge your own ultimate playstyle!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Automated Combat</strong><br>Simply decide on stat distribution, skill sets, and army compositions, then let the battles play out automatically\u2014making your growth experience effortless and fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression System</strong><br>Hero class changes, skill combos, and equipment upgrades\u2014all are yours to freely plan and optimize.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Formidable Boss Fights</strong><br>Every 100 stages brings an encounter with a super-strong boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limitless Growth</strong><br>Keep powering up to push your stats to the absolute limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebirth &amp; Sublimation</strong><br>Choose to reset stages for extra rewards, or use the Sublimation Potion for a more flexible reset experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Idle RPG with Fully Automated Battles.</strong><br>Lead your heroes and armies to conquer challenging stages and powerful bosses. Through equipment, skills, and hero class changes, you can forge your own ultimate playstyle!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Automated Combat</strong><br>Simply decide on stat distribution, skill sets, and army compositions, then let the battles play out automatically\u2014making your growth experience effortless and fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression System</strong><br>Hero class changes, skill combos, and equipment upgrades\u2014all are yours to freely plan and optimize.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Formidable Boss Fights</strong><br>Every 100 stages brings an encounter with a super-strong boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limitless Growth</strong><br>Keep powering up to push your stats to the absolute limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebirth &amp; Sublimation</strong><br>Choose to reset stages for extra rewards, or use the Sublimation Potion for a more flexible reset experience.</p></li></ul>",
